to stay with me. man.

1435
01:14:01.855 --> 01:14:02.991
Hey. Hey. look at me.

1436
01:14:03.124 --> 01:14:05.193
[indistinct chatter
in the distance]

1437
01:14:05.726 --> 01:14:07.295
[clattering]

1438
01:14:07.996 --> 01:14:09.230
[thunder rumbling]

1439
01:14:09.362 --> 01:14:11.233
Just couldn't help yourself.
could you?

1440
01:14:11.365 --> 01:14:13.467
I did nothing to stop this.

1441
01:14:15.369 --> 01:14:16.369
What?

1442
01:14:16.671 --> 01:14:18.139
The dinosaurs.

1443
01:14:19.573 --> 01:14:23.543
We could've stopped it.
It was just accident.

1444
01:14:24.279 --> 01:14:27.015
[Baker]
An accident?
Why didn't you say this before?

1445
01:14:27.149 --> 01:14:29.550
[Sofia]
I wanted to.
but you are... [sighs]

1446
01:14:30.251 --> 01:14:33.453
- What?
- You are the enemy.

1447
01:14:34.889 --> 01:14:39.659
Lady. I'm not the one
trying to shoot you or eat you.

1448
01:14:39.793 --> 01:14:43.497
I know. I know. I see that now.
You are good men.

1449
01:14:43.631 --> 01:14:46.068
- You are all good men...
- [thunder rumbling]

1450
01:14:46.201 --> 01:14:48.369
but I needed
more than good men.

1451
01:14:48.904 --> 01:14:50.805
I needed someone who could stop

1452
01:14:50.939 --> 01:14:52.773
what is happening
in this valley.

1453
01:14:53.474 --> 01:14:56.077
[Xavier]
Baker. we need more eyes
on the perimeter.

1454
01:14:56.710 --> 01:14:58.779
- Leon. help the Sarge.
- [Leon] Yes. Sarge.

1455
01:14:58.914 --> 01:15:00.681
[Xavier]
Leon. cover that window.

1456
01:15:00.815 --> 01:15:03.952
Listen. My mission is
to get my men home.
not fight dinosaurs.

1457
01:15:04.086 --> 01:15:07.956
There won't be a home
if Borodin isn't stopped.

1458
01:15:08.422 --> 01:15:09.857
Look out there!

1459
01:15:10.892 --> 01:15:12.093
[exhales deeply]

1460
01:15:13.060 --> 01:15:15.429
Sofia. what exactly
was going on here?

1461
01:15:15.562 --> 01:15:17.331
[Logan softly]
It's all right. We got you.

1462
01:15:17.464 --> 01:15:19.333
- [suspenseful music]
- Put pressure...

1463
01:15:19.466 --> 01:15:24.005
My husband was
nuclear research scientist.

1464
01:15:25.106 --> 01:15:27.008
My field is paleontology.

1465
01:15:27.508 --> 01:15:30.344
We were sent here
by Soviet madman Borodin

1466
01:15:30.477 --> 01:15:34.115
to do what was
strictly research.

1467
01:15:36.117 --> 01:15:38.285
Nobody conducts
scientific research

1468
01:15:38.419 --> 01:15:40.688
in the middle of a jungle
in the middle of a war.

1469
01:15:40.822 --> 01:15:44.625
Even Russia didn't want
his research on home ground.

1470
01:15:45.292 --> 01:15:47.195
When you are ordered
to do something

1471
01:15:47.328 --> 01:15:51.032
by a man like Borodin.
you do it or you die!

1472
01:15:52.633 --> 01:15:53.700
[exhales sharply]

1473
01:15:54.202 --> 01:15:57.839
When we arrived. this collider
had already been tested.

1474
01:15:58.672 --> 01:16:01.142
We were told that
he was working on wormholes

1475
01:16:01.275 --> 01:16:03.812
so that Soviet Union
could crush America.

1476
01:16:03.945 --> 01:16:06.214
send tanks
onto White House lawn.

1477
01:16:07.481 --> 01:16:10.351
But my husband said
that Borodin...

1478
01:16:11.452 --> 01:16:13.687
- cut corners. you would say.
- [music continues]

1479
01:16:14.321 --> 01:16:19.393
Particles did not collide
and some elements slingshot
beyond speed of light.

1480
01:16:20.461 --> 01:16:21.461
[exhales sharply]

1481
01:16:21.997 --> 01:16:27.102
Wormhole... opened in the past
and dinosaurs walked through.

1482
01:16:27.234 --> 01:16:29.837
- [thunder rumbling]
- [exhales sharply]

1483
01:16:31.271 --> 01:16:34.809
I came with my husband
because of my knowledge.

1484
01:16:35.609 --> 01:16:36.878
[exhales deeply]

1485
01:16:37.444 --> 01:16:38.444
Best team.

1486
01:16:38.546 --> 01:16:40.581
[melancholic music]

1487
01:16:41.049 --> 01:16:42.249
Where's your husband now?

1488
01:16:42.917 --> 01:16:46.486
[crying] I was out
studying the herbivores
that came through.

1489
01:16:48.123 --> 01:16:50.357
Borodin wanted to... see

1490
01:16:50.491 --> 01:16:53.427
if he could make use
of the dinosaurs.

1491
01:16:54.963 --> 01:17:01.302
I heard cracking of machine guns
and came home... [sobs softly]
to find whole team dead.

1492
01:17:02.370 --> 01:17:04.872
Darling husband included.
And so I've sat here.

1493
01:17:05.006 --> 01:17:07.608
doing the only thing I can
to ease the pain.

1494
01:17:08.409 --> 01:17:11.846
We should have stopped him.
He just left his mess of lizards

1495
01:17:11.979 --> 01:17:14.749
and moved on to rebuild
another collider.

1496
01:17:14.883 --> 01:17:16.250
He won't stop.

1497
01:17:17.152 --> 01:17:19.954
Look at where
playing God got us.

1498
01:17:20.088 --> 01:17:22.222
- [thunder rumbling]
- [softly] Hmm?

1499
01:17:23.892 --> 01:17:25.225
I know.

1500
01:17:27.896 --> 01:17:30.397
[Baker]
You know where this
rebuilt collider is?

1501
01:17:32.067 --> 01:17:34.568
[sniffles] They entered
a river in the mountains.

1502
01:17:35.704 --> 01:17:38.238
He thinks I'm dead.
but I know about it.

1503
01:17:39.239 --> 01:17:41.043
You have to help me
make this right

1504
01:17:41.175 --> 01:17:44.445
or more people
will suffer the consequence.

1505
01:17:44.579 --> 01:17:46.814
[music continues]

1506
01:17:51.687 --> 01:17:54.221
- [Baker] How we looking?
- [Xavier] Uh. not good.

1507
01:17:56.791 --> 01:18:01.996
-[shushes. softly] It's okay.
It's okay. man. It's okay.
-[crying and whimpering]

1508
01:18:02.129 --> 01:18:03.708
- It's all right.
- [Keyes] I wanna go home.

1509
01:18:03.732 --> 01:18:05.341
[Logan]
We're gonna get you
back home. man.

1510
01:18:05.365 --> 01:18:06.844
What you gonna tell
your mama about this?

1511
01:18:06.868 --> 01:18:09.403
- [thunder rumbling]
- [screeching]

1512
01:18:10.604 --> 01:18:13.540
[roaring and sniffing]

1513
01:18:13.675 --> 01:18:16.077
[rain spattering]

1514
01:18:17.946 --> 01:18:20.414
- [Miller] You good?
- [sighs] Yeah.

1515
01:18:21.382 --> 01:18:23.583
[sighs] Yeah. these things
just freak me out. man.

1516
01:18:25.753 --> 01:18:27.021
You can handle it.

1517
01:18:28.189 --> 01:18:29.290
[Eli]
Yeah.

1518
01:18:30.224 --> 01:18:32.092
I'd handle it better
if I had me a drink.

1519
01:18:32.660 --> 01:18:34.662
Should've brought along
that lucky flask.

1520
01:18:35.529 --> 01:18:38.131
[Miller]
Baker catches you
with that flask in the field.

1521
01:18:39.100 --> 01:18:40.635
he's gonna jam it up your ass.

1522
01:18:41.201 --> 01:18:43.337
That little flask
saved my ass one time.

1523
01:18:45.640 --> 01:18:48.409
When you and I were
running for CAV.
before we went to the LURPs...

1524
01:18:48.542 --> 01:18:50.745
[light melancholic music]

1525
01:18:50.879 --> 01:18:52.914
we're clearing out
this little. uh.

1526
01:18:53.048 --> 01:18:55.115
this little
piss ant village... [sniffs]

1527
01:18:55.549 --> 01:18:57.509
Charlie jumped out
from behind a pile of bamboo

1528
01:18:57.551 --> 01:19:00.022
and just fucking nailed me
with one round from his SKS.

1529
01:19:00.154 --> 01:19:03.157
The round hit the flask
in my pocket. flattened it.

1530
01:19:03.290 --> 01:19:06.226
but all I got was
knocked in my ass.

1531
01:19:09.631 --> 01:19:11.933
If it hadn't been
for that flask in my pocket...

1532
01:19:13.869 --> 01:19:15.604
- That was God.
- [Eli] Mm.

1533
01:19:16.137 --> 01:19:17.805
But I remember well.

1534
01:19:19.339 --> 01:19:21.041
That what happened after that...

1535
01:19:23.077 --> 01:19:25.179
never gonna forget
those four people.

1536
01:19:26.180 --> 01:19:27.457
Gonna take more
than a whisky flask

1537
01:19:27.481 --> 01:19:29.017
- to save your ass this time.
- Yeah.

1538
01:19:29.517 --> 01:19:31.919
Gonna take more than God
to save yours.

1539
01:19:33.988 --> 01:19:34.988
Where is he?

1540
01:19:35.690 --> 01:19:38.258
He's not there.
You're here. They're here.

1541
01:19:40.795 --> 01:19:41.896
That's what I believe in.

1542
01:19:42.630 --> 01:19:44.866
[Miller]
You know why I carry
these beads every day?

1543
01:19:45.667 --> 01:19:48.201
I'm asking those people
we killed for forgiveness.

1544
01:19:48.335 --> 01:19:50.271
Nah. the fuckings...
Don't listen to me. man.

1545
01:19:50.404 --> 01:19:52.974
- I'm just fucked up.
- [Logan] Hey. you still
with me. Keyes?

1546
01:19:53.107 --> 01:19:54.543
- Keyes. wake up!
- [Xavier] What?

1547
01:19:55.142 --> 01:19:56.386
[Eli]
Keyes is gonna
fucking die for sure

1548
01:19:56.410 --> 01:19:57.810
if we don't get him
outta here. man.

1549
01:19:57.879 --> 01:19:59.413
[Miller]
He's gonna make it. [sniffs]

1550
01:19:59.548 --> 01:20:02.918
- [roaring in the distance]
- Hey. Sarge. we got movement.

1551
01:20:03.050 --> 01:20:05.285
[ominous music]

1552
01:20:06.654 --> 01:20:08.422
Shit. Need more time.

1553
01:20:08.923 --> 01:20:10.558
What's the ETA
on those choppers?

1554
01:20:10.925 --> 01:20:12.561
Last ETA was about an hour.

1555
01:20:12.694 --> 01:20:14.896
Fucking rotor heads
don't like flying at night.

1556
01:20:15.028 --> 01:20:16.540
- [Baker] Fuck.
- Can we hold for an hour?

1557
01:20:16.564 --> 01:20:19.701
They still out there.
just pacing the perimeter.

1558
01:20:19.834 --> 01:20:21.670
Logan. need you out here.

1559
01:20:21.803 --> 01:20:23.346
[Logan]
You're gonna get
to the other side of this.

1560
01:20:23.370 --> 01:20:25.305
- you're gonna be fine.
- Go. I got him.

1561
01:20:25.439 --> 01:20:28.075
- Hang in there. I'll be back.
- [Baker] Grab your left.

1562
01:20:28.843 --> 01:20:30.779
[thunder rumbling]

1563
01:20:30.912 --> 01:20:33.013
[roaring in the distance]

1564
01:20:34.749 --> 01:20:35.625
What's going on?

1565
01:20:35.637 --> 01:20:38.251
Let me know when you
got a target you can shoot.

1566
01:20:38.385 --> 01:20:40.954
[growling]

1567
01:20:47.929 --> 01:20:49.396
[softly]
He's just walking around.

1568
01:20:50.130 --> 01:20:51.332
[Baker]
You got a shot?

1569
01:20:52.166 --> 01:20:54.034
You want me to give away
our position?

1570
01:20:55.136 --> 01:20:56.904
They already know we're here.

1571
01:21:00.107 --> 01:21:02.443
- Lost it.
- Stay on it.

1572
01:21:04.144 --> 01:21:07.415
- Pretty smart for a bird.
- Way too smart for a bird.

1573
01:21:07.549 --> 01:21:09.749
Listen. man. I found out
some shit talking to the woman.

1574
01:21:09.784 --> 01:21:11.553
- [roaring]
- [shouts] Oh. shit.
they're inside!

1575
01:21:11.687 --> 01:21:13.954
- There's a bird!
- [roaring]

1576
01:21:14.088 --> 01:21:16.525
[gunshots]

1577
01:21:16.658 --> 01:21:18.860
[dramatic music]

1578
01:21:19.694 --> 01:21:21.261
[Xavier]
Get on it. Left. left.

1579
01:21:21.929 --> 01:21:23.130
Shit. it's here!

1580
01:21:23.964 --> 01:21:25.132
[Baker]
Go. go!

1581
01:21:29.737 --> 01:21:32.674
- [indistinct shouting]
- Miller!

1582
01:21:33.542 --> 01:21:35.811
- [man 1] Spread out!
- [man 2] Yeah! Let's go!

1583
01:21:35.943 --> 01:21:37.044
Left!

1584
01:21:41.416 --> 01:21:44.251
- Motherfucker!
- [Miller] Here.
here. here. here!

1585
01:21:46.186 --> 01:21:47.354
[man 3]
Cease fire!

1586
01:21:47.755 --> 01:21:48.889
Cease fire!

1587
01:21:49.858 --> 01:21:51.258
Everyone. full mag.

1588
01:21:51.726 --> 01:21:52.827
[gun cocks]

1589
01:21:54.228 --> 01:21:56.497
It's probing us.
goddamn it. it's probing us.

1590
01:21:56.631 --> 01:21:58.031
[suspenseful music]

1591
01:21:58.165 --> 01:22:01.034
Eyes on. eyes on.
Quick as you can.

1592
01:22:03.838 --> 01:22:05.038
[thud]

1593
01:22:07.341 --> 01:22:09.610
[thudding]

1594
01:22:09.744 --> 01:22:11.647
[growling]

1595
01:22:12.046 --> 01:22:13.980
- [Baker] The fuck is that?
- Got it.

1596
01:22:14.683 --> 01:22:16.316
[gunshots]

1597
01:22:16.451 --> 01:22:17.918
[clinking]

1598
01:22:21.321 --> 01:22:24.393
- [screeching]
- [gunshots]

1599
01:22:24.526 --> 01:22:26.595
[dramatic music]

1600
01:22:26.961 --> 01:22:28.128
[yells] Fuck!

1601
01:22:30.965 --> 01:22:32.232
[Baker]
On your left! Whoa!

1602
01:22:34.603 --> 01:22:37.137
[shouts] Get out!

1603
01:22:37.705 --> 01:22:39.374
- [roaring]
- [yelling]

1604
01:22:39.508 --> 01:22:42.042
- [Baker] Fall back! Fall back!
- [Eli] Fall back!

1605
01:22:44.379 --> 01:22:46.481
[Baker]
Go. go. go. go! Go. go. go. go!

1606
01:22:47.715 --> 01:22:49.049
Leon. move!

1607
01:22:51.952 --> 01:22:54.221
[roaring and growling]

1608
01:22:56.558 --> 01:22:58.326
There are six in the flock
that came through!

1609
01:22:58.460 --> 01:23:00.495
They will find a way!
They always find a way!

1610
01:23:00.629 --> 01:23:02.869
Hey. don't worry about it.
Our chopper's
on its way. okay?

1611
01:23:02.896 --> 01:23:05.600
- [glass shatters]
- [Baker] Shit. Up top!

1612
01:23:05.733 --> 01:23:06.877
- [Xavier] Up. up!
- [Baker] Up top!

1613
01:23:06.901 --> 01:23:09.471
[gunshots]

1614
01:23:10.037 --> 01:23:11.905
- [thudding]
- [glass shatters]

1615
01:23:12.039 --> 01:23:15.142
- Son of a bitch!
- [indistinct shouting]

1616
01:23:15.543 --> 01:23:17.613
He won't survive an hour!
Your men still die!

1617
01:23:17.746 --> 01:23:20.981
- What would you have me do?
- There's a boat
on the docks outside.

1618
01:23:21.115 --> 01:23:22.875
- There's a boat there?
- Yes. it needs fixing.

1619
01:23:22.916 --> 01:23:24.786
that is not my skill.
Your men can.

1620
01:23:25.252 --> 01:23:27.130
Look. there's a escape hole
over there. the vents.

1621
01:23:27.154 --> 01:23:28.590
-Fuck...
-Trust me!

1622
01:23:28.724 --> 01:23:32.860
Open it. Everybody. we're
moving out through the vent!

1623
01:23:32.993 --> 01:23:34.130
Leon. give Sofia a hand.

1624
01:23:34.142 --> 01:23:36.264
Okay. we're gonna do
a new LZ. Keyes. okay?

1625
01:23:36.398 --> 01:23:38.409
-We're gonna move you to...
-[Keyes] I can't. I can't.

1626
01:23:38.433 --> 01:23:41.135
- Move. Keyes. Grab a leg.
- [Keyes] Put me in the corner.

1627
01:23:41.268 --> 01:23:42.870
- [Baker] Huh?
- [Keyes] Corner!

1628
01:23:43.004 --> 01:23:45.316
- Put me in the fucking corner.
- He wants to go in the corner.

1629
01:23:45.340 --> 01:23:46.617
[Logan]
No. no. no. no.
no. no. no. we...

1630
01:23:46.641 --> 01:23:47.742
- He wants to go.
- We...

1631
01:23:47.875 --> 01:23:49.009
- It's his decision.
- man.

1632
01:23:49.142 --> 01:23:50.844
-We're not doing...
-Three. two. one.

1633
01:23:50.978 --> 01:23:52.846
[Keyes groans]

1634
01:23:52.980 --> 01:23:54.114
Move it!

1635
01:23:55.751 --> 01:23:57.295
- [Logan] What are we doing?
- [Sofia] We need
to open this vent.

1636
01:23:57.319 --> 01:23:59.321
- [cross talk]
- God be with you. Keyes.

1637
01:23:59.454 --> 01:24:00.788
-God be...
-[Baker] Go. go. go. go.

1638
01:24:00.921 --> 01:24:02.056
[Sofia shouts]
Sergeant!

1639
01:24:02.491 --> 01:24:04.560
- Give me a grenade.
- I gotcha. I gotcha.

1640
01:24:04.693 --> 01:24:07.262
- I got you. I got you.
- Fuck no. man. Don't do this.

1641
01:24:07.395 --> 01:24:09.173
- Give me
a fucking grenade and go.
- [Baker] I got you.

1642
01:24:09.197 --> 01:24:10.831
- [thudding]
- [roaring]

1643
01:24:10.965 --> 01:24:12.199
[Xavier]
Let's go. let's go!

1644
01:24:12.333 --> 01:24:13.900
- [Sofia] Go!
- [Keyes breathing heavily]

1645
01:24:14.034 --> 01:24:16.371
-Man...
-Oh. my God.

1646
01:24:16.937 --> 01:24:17.651
[Logan] Baker.

1647
01:24:17.663 --> 01:24:19.840
You're not going anywhere
humping a fucking casualty.

1648
01:24:19.973 --> 01:24:21.809
- Be quick!
- [speaks indistinctly]

1649
01:24:21.942 --> 01:24:23.053
I can't do this
without you. man.

1650
01:24:23.077 --> 01:24:24.345
-Yeah. you can...
-I can't.

1651
01:24:24.479 --> 01:24:26.089
-The voices in my head...
- you fucking can!

1652
01:24:26.113 --> 01:24:28.182
- [crying]
- You fucking listen to me.

1653
01:24:28.316 --> 01:24:29.817
Th... they're trying to hurt you.

1654
01:24:29.951 --> 01:24:31.586
- [thudding]
- [roaring]

1655
01:24:31.952 --> 01:24:33.988
- You want a cigarette?
- [shakily] Yeah.

1656
01:24:34.356 --> 01:24:36.723
- Okay. Let's go.
- [crying]

1657
01:24:36.857 --> 01:24:39.092
[somber music]

1658
01:24:40.295 --> 01:24:41.295
[gasps]

1659
01:24:41.663 --> 01:24:43.097
Here you go. Enjoy that. Okay.

1660
01:24:43.231 --> 01:24:45.233
- [mumbles]
- [Baker] Logan!

1661
01:24:45.366 --> 01:24:47.902
[glass shatters]

1662
01:24:48.035 --> 01:24:49.836
You're a goddamn hero. man.

1663
01:24:51.272 --> 01:24:54.509
G... go. F... fucking go.

1664
01:24:54.642 --> 01:24:57.978
- Fucking go. man!
- [thudding continues]

